<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 01:46:20 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>OpenAI 悄然提升了 Astra 的一些评估指标，并在发布后继续改变其他指标</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/openai-quietly-boosts-some-of-astras-evaluation-metrics-amid-rare-delay-in-publication-of-the-modeblog-post-announcement/</link><description>OpenAI 博客上有关 Astra 的数字不断变化。在某些情况下，这些变化使 Astra 看起来更好，而竞争对手的车型看起来更糟。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2292640403-e1788541880552.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:12:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/openai-quietly-boosts-some-of-astras-evaluation-metrics-amid-rare-delay-in-publication-of-the-modeblog-post-announcement/</guid></item><item><title>比特币的交易再次更像是“黄金的放大版”，但四年周期理论可能会进一步下跌</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/bitcoin-amplified-gold-four-year-cycle-theory-price-rally-safe-haven-dollar-bond-market-volatility-downside-risk/</link><description>一些分析师警告称，今年晚些时候完成的四年周期可能会带来另一次下滑。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2291864174-e1788552788603.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 20:29:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/bitcoin-amplified-gold-four-year-cycle-theory-price-rally-safe-haven-dollar-bond-market-volatility-downside-risk/</guid></item><item><title>丹麦和四个欧盟国家就欧盟外移民“返回中心”达成一致，计划于 2027 年启动</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/five-eu-countries-migrant-return-hub-human-rights/</link><description>荷兰庇护和移民部长巴特·范登布林克（Bart van den Brink）表示：“这是新事物，具有开创性。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2223740340-e1788552747656.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 20:22:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/five-eu-countries-migrant-return-hub-human-rights/</guid></item><item><title>“喂养野兽”：Meta 在新诉讼中面临使用其“变态眼镜”训练人工智能的指控</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/meta-perv-glasses-ai-lawsuit/</link><description>在同意达成同类最大的儿童安全和解协议几周后，这家科技巨头面临新的隐私诉讼。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2235451108-e1788549079700.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 19:28:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/meta-perv-glasses-ai-lawsuit/</guid></item><item><title>司法部将牛肉价格调查范围扩大到沃尔玛和亚马逊等八家零售商，通货膨胀是中期选举前的一个关键问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/doj-amazon-walmart-beef-inflation-midterms/</link><description>对零售商的新调查似乎是建立在该部门对肉类加工商的反垄断调查的基础上的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1165786294-e1788546292113.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 18:45:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/doj-amazon-walmart-beef-inflation-midterms/</guid></item><item><title>阿根廷总理米莱威胁对福克兰群岛石油开发商实施制裁，同时援引特朗普愿意重新考虑美国的立场</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/trump-milei-argentina-uk-falklands/</link><description>阿根廷总统认为石油开发将巩固英国的存在，增加数十年领土争端的经济风险&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26246528405125-e1788534593728.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 18:30:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/trump-milei-argentina-uk-falklands/</guid></item><item><title>顶级主权财富基金可能会抛售 800 亿美元的国债，并买入风险更大的其他类型的美国债务</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/top-sovereign-wealth-fund-treasury-bonds-us-risk-premium-mortgage-backed-securities/</link><description>以美元计价的资产的总体风险敞口将基本保持在 52.5% 不变，而当前投资组合下的风险敞口为 52.9%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1216614297-e1788531267667.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 18:27:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/top-sovereign-wealth-fund-treasury-bonds-us-risk-premium-mortgage-backed-securities/</guid></item><item><title>从 Target 库房到工厂车间：塑造《财富》最具影响力女性的第一份工作</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/05/29/fortune-most-powerful-women-2026-first-jobs-from-target-stockrooms-to-factory-floors-early-career-foundations/</link><description>《财富》2026 年最具影响力女性排行榜上的领导者最早的雄心可以追溯到她们的第一份工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/GettyImages-2147840443-e1779299452586.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 11:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/05/29/fortune-most-powerful-women-2026-first-jobs-from-target-stockrooms-to-factory-floors-early-career-foundations/</guid></item><item><title>尽管玛丽·巴拉经营着价值 650 亿美元的汽车制造商通用汽车，但她仍然会回复她亲手收到的“每一封信”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/mary-barra-leadership-style-ceo-handwritten-notes-general-motors/</link><description>想引起像通用汽车老板玛丽·巴拉这样的首席执行官的注意吗？给她写一封信。她很可能会阅读它甚至做出回应。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/FWD.1123.Mary-Barra-GM-2022.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Mar 2026 15:01:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/mary-barra-leadership-style-ceo-handwritten-notes-general-motors/</guid></item><item><title>谁在管理劳动力市场？ 8 月份美国新增就业岗位中 98% 为女性</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/jobs-report-september-women-162000-jobs/</link><description>经济增加了 162,000 个就业岗位，几乎是预测的三倍，但增长的成果异常集中在女性身上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-961036490-e1788531820786.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 14:24:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/04/jobs-report-september-women-162000-jobs/</guid></item></channel></rss>